# API5 - Broken Function Level Authorisation
# Detects access to an administrative endpoint by path match.
# Maps to OWASP API5, NIST CSF 2.0 DE.CM
#
# Validated 19 Sep 2026: a standard user token returned HTTP 200.
# Known limitation: the access log records client IP, not authenticated
# identity, so this rule cannot distinguish legitimate administrative use
# from privilege escalation.

index=main sourcetype=access_combined uri_path="/workshop/api/shop/orders/all"
| stats count BY clientip, _time
